                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Lakini huyo Yonathani, mwana wake Sauli, alikuwa akipendezwa sana na Daudi. Basi Yonathani akamwambia Daudi, akasema, Sauli, baba yangu, anakusudia kukuua; basi, nakusihi, ujiangalie sana asubuhi, ukae mahali pa siri na kujificha; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
