        },
        {
          "text": " Kwa kuwa alihatarisha maisha yake, na kumpiga yule Mfilisti, naye BWANA akawatendea Israeli wote wokovu mkuu. Wewe mwenyewe uliona jambo hilo, ukafurahi; basi kwa nini kukosa juu ya damu isiyo na hatia, umwue huyo Daudi bure? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sauli akaisikiliza sauti ya Yonathani; naye Sauli akaapa, Aishivyo BWANA, yeye hatauawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi Yonathani akamwita Daudi, naye Yonathani akamjulisha mambo hayo yote. Kisha Yonathani akamleta Daudi kwa Sauli, naye alikuwa akihudumu mbele yake, kama hapo awali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mikali amsaidia Daudi kumtoroka Sauli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
