              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baada ya hayo kulikuwa na vita tena; naye Daudi akatoka, naye akapigana na Wafilisti, naye akawaua kwa uuaji mkuu; nao wakakimbia mbele yake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
